			"notes": "## ⚠️ Alpha Release\n\nThis is an early port of Exposure to Fabric 1.21.11. Not all mechanics have been fully tested.\n\n### ✅ Working\n- Camera item and basic UI\n- Film loading and ejection\n- Basic photo capture\n\n### 🔧 Known Issues\n- [ ] Some rendering glithces in camera stand\n- [ ] ...\n\n### 📦 Requirements\n- Minecraft 1.21.11\n- Fabric Loader ≥ 0.16.x\n- Fabric API for 1.21.11\n- Forge Config Api latest\n- \n\n### 📥 Installation\nDrop the `.jar` into your `mods/` folder.\n<img width=\"1708\" height=\"960\" alt=\"2026-04-17_12 13 04\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/325eac8b-6e47-420a-95ec-ef0a4b777805\" />"
